---
import { Code } from 'astro:components';
import claimNext from '../data/claim-next.txt?raw';
---

<section id="code">
  <h3>The export queue is a table</h3>
  <p>
    CSV exports run in the background. Instead of adding a broker, the <code>export_jobs</code>{' '}
    table is the queue: each worker claims one job in a single statement, and{' '}
    <code>SKIP LOCKED</code> lets several workers run without taking the same job.
  </p>
  <Code
    code={claimNext.trimEnd()}
    lang="rust"
    themes={{ light: 'github-light-high-contrast', dark: 'github-dark-default' }}
    defaultColor={false}
  />
</section>
